cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this annotation or pipeline, please cite the genome paper below."
title: "Siganus fuscescens genome annotation v2"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible structural and functional re-annotation of the Siganus fuscescens
  reference assembly GCA_042847805.1 (Sfus_1.0). Combines evidence-based gene
  prediction (BRAKER3 with RNA-seq and protein hints) with an independent
  deep-learning prediction (Helixer) and a congener annotation transfer
  (Liftoff), consolidated with TSEBRA and filtered on four independent evidence
  axes. Adds repeat, non-coding RNA and functional annotation absent from the
  2024 release.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mwamburi
    given-names: Samuel M.
    email: mwakishasam@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kishaz/Siganus_fuscescens-Genome_annotation_v2"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - genome annotation
  - Siganus fuscescens
  - Siganidae
  - rabbitfish
  - BRAKER3
  - Helixer
references:
