    title: >-
      De Novo Assembly and Annotation of the Siganus fuscescens (Houttuyn, 1782)
      Genome: Marking a Pioneering Advance for the Siganidae Family
    doi: 10.1007/s10126-024-10325-9
    journal: Marine Biotechnology
